From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Englund <tomenglund26@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:26:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nvidia-modeset: fetch KAPI events in batches

nvKmsKapiHandleEventQueueChange() fetched queued NVKMS events for
nvidia-drm one NVKMS_IOCTL_GET_NEXT_EVENT at a time until the queue was
empty, so a single flip completion event cost two nvkms_lock acquisitions
on the NVKMS kthread (one for the event, one for the "no event" reply) on
top of the one for the deferred work that queued it. Each acquisition can
queue behind a long nvkms_lock holder.

Add NVKMS_IOCTL_GET_NEXT_EVENTS (kernel-space clients only), which pops up
to 8 events and says whether more are queued, and use it in KAPI: one
acquisition per batch. The conversion to NvKmsKapiEvent moves to
DispatchKmsEvent(), shared by both fetch loops (the "err" path was dead).

nvidia_modeset.batch_kapi_events=0 (module parameter, writable at runtime)
goes back to one event per ioctl.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../nvidia-modeset/nvidia-modeset-linux.c     |  11 ++
 .../nvidia-modeset-os-interface.h             |   1 +
 src/nvidia-modeset/interface/nvkms-api.h      |  26 ++++
 src/nvidia-modeset/kapi/src/nvkms-kapi.c      | 132 +++++++++++-------
 .../include/nvidia-modeset-os-interface.h     |   1 +
 src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms.c                |  42 ++++++
 6 files changed, 162 insertions(+), 51 deletions(-)

diff --git a/kernel-open/nvidia-modeset/nvidia-modeset-linux.c b/kernel-open/nvidia-modeset/nvidia-modeset-linux.c
index 1f21478b..d8787738 100644
--- a/kernel-open/nvidia-modeset/nvidia-modeset-linux.c
+++ b/kernel-open/nvidia-modeset/nvidia-modeset-linux.c
@@ -149,6 +149,12 @@ MODULE_PARM_DESC(unlocked_backlight,
 static bool unlocked_backlight = true;
 module_param_named(unlocked_backlight, unlocked_backlight, bool, 0644);
 
+MODULE_PARM_DESC(batch_kapi_events,
+                 "Fetch NVKMS events (e.g. flip completions) for nvidia-drm in batches, "
+                 "taking the global NVKMS lock once per batch instead of once per event plus once more.");
+static bool batch_kapi_events = true;
+module_param_named(batch_kapi_events, batch_kapi_events, bool, 0644);
+
 MODULE_PARM_DESC(enhanced_pcon_support,
                  "Enable enhanced display protocol converter features (e.g. VRR over active DP-HDMI converters)");
 static bool enhanced_pcon_support = false;
@@ -270,6 +276,11 @@ NvBool nvkms_unlocked_surface_rm(void)
     return READ_ONCE(unlocked_surface_rm);
 }
 
+NvBool nvkms_batch_kapi_events(void)
+{
+    return READ_ONCE(batch_kapi_events);
+}
+
 NvBool nvkms_output_rounding_fix(void)
 {
     return output_rounding_fix;
diff --git a/kernel-open/nvidia-modeset/nvidia-modeset-os-interface.h b/kernel-open/nvidia-modeset/nvidia-modeset-os-interface.h
index 09f465fd..abe27af8 100644
